{
  "_comment": "Same fictional site after the refresh of /blog/first-pitch/ shipped: new title, og:url on the right host, no leftover template token or brief comment, the trailing-slash duplicate now 301s, robots.txt declares only its own sitemap. Used by the verify and diff tests.",
